msgid "Clear the KV cache"
msgstr "清除 KV 缓存"

#: ../../source/kv_cache_management/clear.rst:6
msgid "The ``clear`` interface is defined as the following:"
msgstr "``clear`` 接口定义如下："

#: ../../source/kv_cache_management/clear.rst:12
msgid ""
"The function removes the KV cache stored at ``location`` for the "
"specified ``instance_id``. It returns an ``event_id`` and the number of "
"tokens scheduled for clearing."
msgstr "该函数移除指定 ``instance_id`` 在 ``location`` 处存储的 KV 缓存。它返回一个 ``event_id`` 和计划清除的 token 数量。"

